                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[u]I played this on the Oculus Rift with Touch Controllers.[/u]  I started out at ground level and couldn't interact with anything.  So I did the Ol' run Windows 7 compatibility trick and it fixed it.  No issues.  It does show HTC vive controllers in your hand, but the buttons work exactly the same on the Touch.  \n\nThis is a cute, little puzzle game.  You're supposed to lead the mouse to the cheese.  It starts out very easy, but then gets increasingly difficult as you go along.  Nice visuals.  Nice sounds.  Nice hats.   I didn't notice the gameplay isssues.  The puzzles may be too difficult for small kids actually :O\n\nRating 7/10 No cheese for you, but it's free.",
